/**
 * Mixin for entity types that are exempt from the {@link Facility} filter.
 * If a type mixes this type, it will not be filtered by the {@link Facility}s that the user has access to.
 * This should be mixed into entity types that do not need to be restricted by the {@link Facility}s that
 * the user has access to.
 *
 * This does not need to be mixed into entity types using `kv` data store since types stored in Cassandra
 * can only be fetched given the correct partition key. All `kv` data store types are always exempt from
 * the {@link Facility} filter.
 *
 * Of course, non-entity types are always exempt from the {@link Facility} filter, so they should not mix this type.
 */
abstract entity type ExemptFromFacilityFilter
